### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### 1. Validation should reject a bad URL (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/repositories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gitUrl": "not-a-github-url"
}

### 2. Validation should reject a non-GitHub host (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/repositories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gitUrl": "https://gitlab.com/some/repo"
}

### 3. Submit a real repo (expect 202 + an id)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/repositories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gitUrl": "https://github.com/sohanfernando/task-tracker"
}

### 4. Poll status — paste the id from step 3
GET http://localhost:8080/api/repositories/43ee4eae-a19a-4b2d-9b21-18c5e6f950b5

### 5. List all repos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/repositories

### 6. Ask a question — only works once status is READY
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "repoId": "43ee4eae-a19a-4b2d-9b21-18c5e6f950b5",
  "question": "Is tailwind css used in this project's frontend?"
}

### List models available to my key
GET https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models
x-goog-api-key: {{geminiKey}}